<title>SOUTH AFRICA: ANGLO, NEC JOINT NEWS CONFERENCE 1500 GMT.</title>
<headline>ANGLO, NEC JOINT NEWS CONFERENCE 1500 GMT.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Anglo American Corp of South Africa Ltd said on Wednesday it would hold a joint news conference with the National Empowerment Consortium (NEC) at 1500 GMT.</p>
<p>The announcement follows intense speculation that the two sides have finally reached agreement for the NEC to buy Anglo's 48 percent stake in Johnnies Industrial Corp Ltd .</p>
<p>The deal will be by far the largest black empowerment venture to date.</p>
<p>Johnnic -- whose assets include stakes in South African Breweries , Toyota South Africa  , Premier Group and Times Media -- is also due to announce its year-end results at the same time.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
